### Public health check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Start GitHub OAuth in a browser first, then use the same session for writes
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/github

### Current signed-in player
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Workouts
GET http://localhost:3000/workouts

### Get a workout by id
GET http://localhost:3000/workouts/PASTE_ID_HERE

### Create workout (requires GitHub session)
POST http://localhost:3000/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leg Day",
  "type": "strength",
  "difficulty": 7,
  "durationMinutes": 50,
  "xpReward": 220,
  "exercises": [{ "name": "Squats", "sets": 4, "reps": 10 }]
}

### Update workout (requires GitHub session and ownership)
PUT http://localhost:3000/workouts/PASTE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leg Day",
  "type": "strength",
  "difficulty": 8,
  "durationMinutes": 55,
  "xpReward": 250,
  "exercises": [{ "name": "Squats", "sets": 5, "reps": 10 }],
  "completed": true
}

### Delete workout (requires GitHub session and ownership)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/workouts/PASTE_ID_HERE

### Players
GET http://localhost:3000/players

### Get a player by id
GET http://localhost:3000/players/PASTE_ID_HERE

### Create player (requires GitHub session)
POST http://localhost:3000/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "workoutfan",
  "displayName": "Workout Fan",
  "email": "workoutfan@example.com",
  "totalXp": 0,
  "level": 1
}

### Update player you created or your own OAuth profile
PUT http://localhost:3000/players/PASTE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "workoutfan",
  "displayName": "Workout Fan",
  "email": "workoutfan@example.com",
  "totalXp": 350,
  "level": 3
}

### Delete player you created or your own OAuth profile
DELETE http://localhost:3000/players/PASTE_ID_HERE

